<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">To the distant light above,</font></b></font></font>

27
00:01:13,970 --> 00:01:17,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">ON THE WAY</font></b></font></font>

28
00:01:13,970 --> 00:01:17,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">yes, we are on the way!</font></b></font></font>

29
00:01:21,880 --> 00:01:28,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

30
00:01:21,880 --> 00:01:28,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

31
00:01:30,980 --> 00:01:35,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari! Give me a hand.</font>

32
00:01:51,960 --> 00:01:52,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This mist...</font>

33
00:01:53,670 --> 00:01:56,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke! Sakura! They're coming!</font>

34
00:02:01,510 --> 00:02:03,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew he was still alive.</font>

35
00:02:04,140 --> 00:02:05,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Making an appearance so soon, eh...</font>

36
00:02:06,430 --> 00:02:07,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say, Kakashi-sensei.</font>

37
00:02:07,940 --> 00:02:10,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is his... Hidden Mist Jutsu, right?!</font>

38
00:02:17,740 --> 00:02:19,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry to have kept you waiting, Kakashi.</font>

39
00:02:20,570 --> 00:02:23,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see you've got those brats
with you as always.</font>

40
00:02:24,580 --> 00:02:27,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's still trembling. Poor thing.</font>

41
00:02:38,010 --> 00:02:40,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm trembling with... excitement.</font>

42
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:44,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do it, Sasuke.</font>

43
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can see him!</font>

44
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, well.</font>

45
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:01,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you discerned
the Water Doppelganger Jutsu.</font>

46
00:03:01,740 --> 00:03:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That brat's grown quite a bit.</font>

47
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:07,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This means a rival has emerged, Haku.</font>

48
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it seems.</font>

49
00:03:24,350 --> 00:03:25,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

50
00:03:30,270 --> 00:03:32,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm totally late!</font>

51
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:52,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, well... It seems my prediction
was right on the money.</font>

52
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:54,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Prediction?</font>

53
00:03:54,330 --> 00:03:55,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That little mask...</font>

54
00:03:56,170 --> 00:03:56,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

55
00:03:57,340 --> 00:03:58,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew it... Heh!</font>

56
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:02,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So the Elite Shinobi of
the Hidden Mist thing</font>

57
00:04:02,130 --> 00:04:04,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was a bald-faced lie!</font>

58
00:04:05,180 --> 00:04:07,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how you look at him,
he's gotta be a comrade of Zabuza.</font>

59
00:04:08,430 --> 00:04:10,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Standing together with him and all...</font>

60
00:04:11,230 --> 00:04:14,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How dare he show up like that
after what he did!</font>

61
00:04:14,690 --> 00:04:17,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hate brats who think they're so cool...</font>

62
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:19,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's better than you, Kakashi-sensei.</font>

63
00:04:19,610 --> 00:04:21,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... really?</font>

64
00:04:21,940 --> 00:04:23,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do it.</font>

65
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:24,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

66
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:30,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With his bad acting...
I hate brats who think they're so cool!</font>

67
00:04:30,660 --> 00:04:32,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun, you are so cool!</font>

68
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:37,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Sakura doesn't take stabs at Sasuke...</font>

69
00:04:39,250 --> 00:04:40,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's an impressive youth.</font>

70
00:04:41,510 --> 00:04:42,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm...</font>

71
00:04:42,670 --> 00:04:44,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though those Water Clones</font>

72
00:04:44,510 --> 00:04:48,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have only 1/10th the strength
of their original...</font>

73
00:04:49,100 --> 00:04:50,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think he went that well.</font>

74
00:04:51,850 --> 00:04:53,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, you made
the preemptive move.</font>

75
00:04:54,690 --> 00:04:55,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

76
00:04:56,350 --> 00:04:57,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

77
00:05:00,730 --> 00:05:01,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

78
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:17,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Haku's Master</font>

79
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:17,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Tech-</font>

80
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:17,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">nique</font>

81
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:17,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Mirror</font>

82
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:17,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">of</font>

83
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:17,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Ice Crystals</font>

84
00:05:28,590 --> 00:05:30,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you Tazuna's daughter?</font>

85
00:05:30,850 --> 00:05:33,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, but you're coming with us.</font>

86
00:05:47,410 --> 00:05:48,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mom!</font>

87
00:05:49,490 --> 00:05:51,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't come out!
Get out of here, quick!</font>

88
00:05:52,700 --> 00:05:53,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with you, brat?!</font>

89
00:05:55,910 --> 00:05:57,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall we take him, too?</font>

90
00:05:58,370 --> 00:06:00,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One hostage is fine.</font>

91
00:06:01,840 --> 00:06:02,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hostage...?!</font>

92
00:06:04,170 --> 00:06:05,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then...</font>

93
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:08,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall we kill him?</font>

94
00:06:12,970 --> 00:06:13,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

95
00:06:20,150 --> 00:06:21,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you lay a hand on that child...</font>

96
00:06:22,110 --> 00:06:23,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll bite off my tongue
and kill myself!</font>

97
00:06:28,910 --> 00:06:31,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You want a hostage, right?</font>

98
00:06:39,420 --> 00:06:42,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank your mom, kid.</font>

99
00:06:48,970 --> 00:06:52,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, man...
It's not enough...</font>

100
00:06:52,180 --> 00:06:55,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Knock it off.
You just tried out your sword earlier.</font>

101
00:06:56,180 --> 00:06:58,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forget it already and
let's take the woman.</font>

102
00:07:07,030 --> 00:07:08,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mom, I'm sorry...</font>

103
00:07:09,700 --> 00:07:10,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm so sorry!</font>

104
00:07:13,820 --> 00:07:17,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm weak, so I can't protect you...</font>

105
00:07:25,340 --> 00:07:29,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to die...
I'm scared!</font>

106
00:07:31,180 --> 00:07:32,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You crybaby...</font>

107
00:07:34,890 --> 00:07:37,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you're just gonna cry all day
like the lead in a tragedy?</font>

108
00:07:38,770 --> 00:07:43,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An idiot like you can just
cry forever! You crybaby!</font>

109
00:07:44,650 --> 00:07:47,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's probably tired of crying.</font>

110
00:07:49,070 --> 00:07:52,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, he knows the true meaning of
the word strong.</font>

111
00:07:53,740 --> 00:07:56,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like your father.</font>

112
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:04,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the things I truly hold
dear to myself...</font>

113
00:08:04,130 --> 00:08:08,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I protect them until the end
with both these arms,</font>

114
00:08:08,550 --> 00:08:10,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even if it looks like I might lose my life!</font>

115
00:08:15,550 --> 00:08:16,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari...</font>

116
00:08:26,650 --> 00:08:27,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can I...</font>

117
00:08:29,820 --> 00:08:31,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">can I also become strong...?</font>

118
00:08:37,530 --> 00:08:38,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dad!</font>

119
00:08:42,910 --> 00:08:47,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looking at that beautiful skin
of yours makes me want to cut you.</font>

120
00:08:47,750 --> 00:08:49,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... walk faster.</font>

121
00:08:49,590 --> 00:08:50,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

122
00:08:54,300 --> 00:08:54,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari!</font>

123
00:08:55,590 --> 00:08:58,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? It's just the kid from before.</font>

124
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:04,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get... get away from my mom!</font>

125
00:09:04,730 --> 00:09:07,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man... This brat's hopeless.</font>

126
00:09:08,610 --> 00:09:09,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's do it!</font>

127
00:09:12,820 --> 00:09:14,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you do that, I'll bite off
my tongue and...</font>

128
00:09:16,410 --> 00:09:18,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up. Go to sleep.</font>

129
00:09:18,620 --> 00:09:19,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... na... ri.</font>

130
00:09:32,340 --> 00:09:35,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, well...
He can see that speed, eh...</font>

131
00:09:37,130 --> 00:09:37,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

132
00:09:38,390 --> 00:09:41,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, surround Tazuna-san and
don't move away from me.</font>

133
00:09:42,180 --> 00:09:43,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let Sasuke handle him!</font>

134
00:09:43,810 --> 00:09:44,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

135
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:54,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to have to kill you...</font>

136
00:09:55,610 --> 00:09:58,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like for you to back down.</font>

137
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nonsense...</font>

138
00:10:01,330 --> 00:10:02,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew it...</font>

139
00:10:03,830 --> 00:10:08,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you won't be able to keep up
with my speed.</font>

140
00:10:08,790 --> 00:10:12,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also, I've already made
two preemptive moves.</font>

141
00:10:12,880 --> 00:10:14,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two preemptive moves?</font>

142
00:10:14,590 --> 00:10:17,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The first one is the scattered water.</font>

143
00:10:18,340 --> 00:10:22,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the second one was
blocking one of your hands...</font>

144
00:10:23,010 --> 00:10:27,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore, you'll just be able
to defend my attack...</font>

145
00:10:29,850 --> 00:10:31,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! With one hand he's...?!</font>

146
00:10:35,030 --> 00:10:36,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A one-handed Sign?</font>

147
00:10:37,740 --> 00:10:39,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never seen such a thing before...</font>

148
00:10:42,030 --> 00:10:44,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Thousand Needles of Death!</font>

149
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:52,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So he doesn't want to kill him... eh.</font>

150
00:10:53,460 --> 00:10:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if that's how he really feels...</font>

151
00:10:56,260 --> 00:10:57,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

152
00:11:01,390 --> 00:11:04,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Remember... that training...</font>

153
00:11:12,730 --> 00:11:14,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Build up Chakra at one burst...</font>

154
00:11:32,630 --> 00:11:33,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Substitution Jutsu...?!</font>

155
00:11:34,250 --> 00:11:35,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The woman... Hmm?</font>

156
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:37,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry I was late.</font>

157
00:11:42,090 --> 00:11:45,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heroes usually appear
on the scene late, so...</font>

158
00:11:46,810 --> 00:11:47,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto nii-chan...!</font>

159
00:11:50,850 --> 00:11:53,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inari, you did well!</font>

160
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:54,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

161
00:11:54,610 --> 00:11:59,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks to you distracting them,
I was able to save your mom.</font>

162
00:12:05,870 --> 00:12:09,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-chan... how did you know that
those samurai were here?</font>

163
00:12:11,290 --> 00:12:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the forest, there was a boar that
had been cut-up with a sword.</font>

164
00:12:15,040 --> 00:12:19,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Other than that,
there were trees with lots of cuts.</font>

165
00:12:19,920 --> 00:12:22,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They headed in
the direction of your house...</font>

166
00:12:22,800 --> 00:12:24,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so I got worried.</font>

167
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:27,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

168
00:12:27,550 --> 00:12:28,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

169
00:12:28,970 --> 00:12:31,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it isn't the no-good Ninja
that Tazuna hired...</font>

170
00:12:32,430 --> 00:12:33,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's do it...</font>

171
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:34,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

172
00:12:35,100 --> 00:12:35,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here they come!</font>

173
00:12:41,940 --> 00:12:43,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! Something like that won't work!</font>

174
00:12:46,870 --> 00:12:47,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fools.</font>

175
00:12:48,330 --> 00:12:50,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Prepare yourself!</font>

176
00:13:05,510 --> 00:13:07,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wow...!</font>

177
00:13:09,850 --> 00:13:11,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's done!</font>

178
00:13:14,060 --> 00:13:17,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto nii-chan, you're just like... a Ninja!</font>

179
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:21,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You fool.
I was a Ninja to start with!</font>

180
00:13:31,910 --> 00:13:33,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Build up Chakra at one burst...</font>

181
00:13:35,790 --> 00:13:36,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to the feet!</font>

182
00:13:45,670 --> 00:13:46,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He vanished...</font>

183
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:58,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're surprisingly stupid...</font>

184
00:13:59,100 --> 00:14:03,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From here on...
you'll only defend my attack!</font>

185
00:14:20,290 --> 00:14:22,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think Haku would
lose in speed...</font>

186
00:14:24,880 --> 00:14:28,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that I'm faster than you...</font>

187
00:14:30,220 --> 00:14:34,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't have you mocking our team,
calling them brats...</font>

188
00:14:36,350 --> 00:14:37,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He may not look it,</font>

189
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:40,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but Sasuke is the number one rookie
of the Village Hidden in the Leaves.</font>

190
00:14:41,940 --> 00:14:44,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And Sakura is our sharpest...</font>

191
00:14:46,940 --> 00:14:49,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! Serves you right!</font>

192
00:14:51,740 --> 00:14:55,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the other one is
the number one hyperactive,</font>

193
00:14:55,540 --> 00:14:59,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">knucklehead Ninja, Uzumaki Naruto.</font>

194
00:15:04,040 --> 00:15:05,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have a cold?</font>

195
00:15:05,090 --> 00:15:06,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm okay.</font>

196
00:15:07,510 --> 00:15:11,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway...
Sorry about yesterday, Inari.</font>

197
00:15:12,390 --> 00:15:13,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

198
00:15:15,470 --> 00:15:20,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Branding you a crybaby...
Forget I ever said that.</font>

199
00:15:23,900 --> 00:15:25,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're strong!</font>

200
00:15:34,490 --> 00:15:35,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dang it!</font>

201
00:15:35,740 --> 00:15:38,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... decided never
to cry again, but...</font>

202
00:15:41,830 --> 00:15:48,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now you'll laugh at me again
and call me a crybaby.</font>

203
00:15:51,430 --> 00:15:52,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you saying...?!</font>

204
00:15:55,470 --> 00:15:58,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay... when you're happy.</font>

205
00:16:04,560 --> 00:16:08,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay to cry when you're happy!</font>

206
00:16:10,610 --> 00:16:11,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-chan...</font>

207
00:16:21,250 --> 00:16:25,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then.
I can leave the rest to you, right?</font>

208
00:16:25,580 --> 00:16:26,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

209
00:16:27,340 --> 00:16:30,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, I'm going to hop over
to the bridge for a bit.</font>

210
00:16:32,010 --> 00:16:37,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, it's tough being a hero!
That's for sure!</font>

211
00:16:49,610 --> 00:16:51,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haku, do you know what this means?</font>

212
00:16:51,490 --> 00:16:53,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate, you'll be defeated
by your intended victim...</font>

213
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

214
00:16:59,370 --> 00:17:00,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

215
00:17:05,330 --> 00:17:06,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's unfortunate...</font>

216
00:17:08,210 --> 00:17:10,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this... cold air...?</font>

217
00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:24,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hidden Jutsu!</font>

218
00:17:42,410 --> 00:17:44,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crystal Ice Mirrors!</font>

219
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:54,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it? What's that Jutsu?</font>

220
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:17,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are these... mirrors?!</font>

221
00:18:18,410 --> 00:18:19,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...</font>

222
00:18:19,910 --> 00:18:20,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the world...?!</font>

223
00:18:23,540 --> 00:18:24,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

224
00:18:28,830 --> 00:18:32,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm your opponent, aren't I?</font>

225
00:18:33,170 --> 00:18:37,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since that Jutsu has appeared...
he's done for.</font>

226
00:18:41,390 --> 00:18:43,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then... I'll start.</font>

227
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:49,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I shall show you...
my true speed!</font>

228
00:18:53,650 --> 00:18:54,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

229
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:02,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

230
00:19:22,300 --> 00:19:25,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you make a move,
I'll kill those two!!</font>

231
00:19:36,070 --> 00:19:37,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, Tazuna-san!</font>

232
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:40,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm stepping away from here for a bit.</font>

233
00:19:42,320 --> 00:19:44,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure. Go!</font>

234
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:48,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

235
00:19:49,910 --> 00:19:50,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

236
00:19:53,540 --> 00:19:55,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

237
00:20:13,600 --> 00:20:14,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He caught it?!</font>

238
00:20:30,870 --> 00:20:31,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

239
00:20:40,630 --> 00:20:41,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is it?!</font>

240
00:20:44,720 --> 00:20:48,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's that idiot... that showoff...</font>

241
00:20:50,180 --> 00:20:54,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The number one hyperactive,
knucklehead Ninja...</font>

242
00:21:11,370 --> 00:21:12,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uzumaki Naruto...</font>

243
00:21:13,370 --> 00:21:15,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is finally here!</font>

244
00:21:33,450 --> 00:21:36,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

245
00:21:36,830 --> 00:21:40,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

246
00:21:40,290 --> 00:21:43,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Climbing the mountain, never coming down.</font></b></font></font></font>

247
00:21:43,460 --> 00:21:47,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Break into the contents, never falling down.</font></b></font></font></font>

248
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:53,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">My knee is still shaking, like I was twelve.</font></b></font></font></font>

249
00:21:53,890 --> 00:21:57,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Sneaking out of the classroom, by the back door.</font></b></font></font></font>

250
00:21:57,230 --> 00:22:00,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">A man railed at me twice though, but I didn't care.</font></b></font></font></font>

251
00:22:00,690 --> 00:22:04,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Waiting is wasting for people like me.</font></b></font></font></font>

252
00:22:04,360 --> 00:22:07,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

253
00:22:07,360 --> 00:22:10,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

254
00:22:10,820 --> 00:22:14,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

255
