00:22:41,060 --> 00:22:44,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

261
00:22:44,520 --> 00:22:47,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

262
00:22:47,820 --> 00:22:50,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry...</font></b></font></font></font>

263
00:22:52,600 --> 00:22:54,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Uzumaki Naruto is finally here!</font>

264
00:22:54,600 --> 00:22:55,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">It'll be okay.</font>

265
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:57,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Now that the hero of the story
has appeared,</font>

266
00:22:57,980 --> 00:23:01,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'll smash those stupid
funny-looking mirrors in no time...</font>

267
00:23:01,150 --> 00:23:04,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Huh? Why won't mirrors
made of ice break?</font>

268
00:23:04,440 --> 00:23:05,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Why won't they melt?</font>

269
00:23:06,320 --> 00:23:09,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What the hell is going on here?!</font>

270
00:23:10,740 --> 00:23:13,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next episode:
"No 1 in Surprising People, Naruto joins the Battle!"</font>

271
00:23:13,950 --> 00:23:16,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">As for me, will I be able
to kick butt once again?</font>

